  accTitle: Separate URL and report services
  accDescr: A client sends create requests to the URL service and report requests to the report service. Each service owns a separate data store.
  C["Client"] -->|"Create<br/>short URL"| U["URL<br/>service"]
  C -->|"Get visit<br/>report"| R["Report<br/>service"]
  U -->|"Own URL<br/>records"| D[("URL<br/>database")]
  R -->|"Own report<br/>records"| A[("Report<br/>database")]
